# Zoom Earth

> Zoom Earth is an interactive weather map (satellite imagery, rain radar, and model-based forecasts) with hurricane and tropical cyclone tracking, wildfire monitoring, and place-based weather pages.

This file highlights canonical human-facing pages and common user intents. For broad crawling of dynamic content (places, storms, fires), start with the sitemap files.

## Use Zoom Earth For

- Live satellite map, satellite animation loop, cloud cover, smoke, fog, storms
- Weather radar, rain radar, precipitation radar, rain and snow map, short-term radar forecast (nowcast)
- Hurricane tracker, tropical cyclone tracker, typhoon tracker, storm tracker
- Wildfire map, active fires, heat spots, wildfire smoke
- Forecast maps: precipitation and clouds, wind speed, wind gusts, temperature, heat index, wet-bulb temperature, humidity, dew point, pressure
- Local weather by place (cities, regions, countries)

## Main Pages

- [Home](https://zoom.earth/): Main interactive weather map.
- [Contact](https://zoom.earth/contact/): Support and feedback form.

## Observational Maps (Satellite and Radar)

- [Satellite](https://zoom.earth/maps/satellite/): Near real-time satellite imagery from geostationary satellites.
- [HD Satellite](https://zoom.earth/maps/satellite-hd/): Higher-detail NASA satellite imagery updated daily.
- [Radar](https://zoom.earth/maps/radar/): Near real-time precipitation radar map (rain and snow).

## Model Forecast Maps

- [Precipitation](https://zoom.earth/maps/precipitation/): Forecast rain and snow.
- [Wind Speed](https://zoom.earth/maps/wind-speed/): Forecast surface wind speed.
- [Wind Gusts](https://zoom.earth/maps/wind-gusts/): Forecast wind gust speed.
- [Temperature](https://zoom.earth/maps/temperature/): Forecast air temperature.
- [Feels Like Temperature](https://zoom.earth/maps/temperature-feel/): Forecast apparent temperature (heat index).
- [Wet-Bulb Temperature](https://zoom.earth/maps/temperature-wet-bulb/): Forecast heat-stress indicator.
- [Humidity](https://zoom.earth/maps/humidity/): Forecast relative humidity.
- [Dew Point](https://zoom.earth/maps/dew-point/): Forecast dew point.
- [Pressure](https://zoom.earth/maps/pressure/): Forecast mean sea-level pressure.

