## Data Sources (High Level)

- Satellite imagery: NOAA `GOES`, EUMETSAT `Meteosat`, JMA `Himawari`, KAI `Geo-KOMPSAT`; HD imagery from NASA `Aqua` and `Terra`
- Forecast models: DWD `ICON`, NOAA/NCEP `GFS`
- Tropical systems: `NHC`, `JTWC`, `NRL`, `IBTrACS`
- Fires/heat spots: NASA `FIRMS`
- Map labels: `OpenStreetMap`

## Notes

- Satellite and radar layers are observational products; forecast layers are model-generated output.
- Weather, satellite, radar, storm, and fire data change frequently; prefer canonical URLs from sitemaps.
